  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Energy Efficiency and Network Stability in Kyrgyzstan using Advanced DER Control and SCADA/DMS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Establish a computerized DCC (Distribution Control Center) to shift from the existing manual power operation system into an automated and remote- controlled operation system through the implementation of SCADA (Supervisory Control And Data Acquisition) / DMS (Distribution Management System) S/W (software), including the establishment of communication networks with field devices. 2. Install automation equipment for modernizing the distribution network and reconfigure feeder systems to optimize automated and remote-control functions using the SCADA (Supervisory Control And Data Acquisition) / DMS (Distribution Management System). 3. Operate the DER (Distributed Energy Resource) Control SCADA (Supervisory Control And Data Acquisition) / DMS (Distribution Management System) and provide capacity-building programs, including various technology transfer trainings and study visits to Korea, to enable the Recipient Agency  to independently implement future expansion projects.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To conduct a pilot operation of the SCADA (Supervisory Control And Data Acquisition) / DMS (Distribution Management System) aimed at enhancing the stability and efficiency of the power distribution network in the Kyrgyz Republic.&#x25aa; &#xbd84;&#xc0b0;&#xc804;&#xc6d0; &#xc81c;&#xc5b4; SCADA/DMS&#xb97c; &#xc6b4;&#xc601;&#xd558;&#xace0; &#xd5a5;&#xd6c4; &#xd655;&#xb300;&#xc0ac;&#xc5c5;&#xc744; &#xb3c5;&#xb9bd;&#xc801;&#xc73c;&#xb85c; &#xc2dc;&#xd589;&#xd560; &#xc218; &#xc788;&#xb294; &#xc218;&#xc6d0;&#xae30;&#xad00; &#xb0b4; &#xc778;&#xb825;&#xc591;&#xc131;&#xc744; &#xbaa9;&#xc801;&#xc73c;&#xb85c; &#xb2e4;&#xc591;&#xd55c; &#xae30;&#xc220;&#xc774;&#xc804; &#xad50;&#xc721; &#xbc0f; &#xad6d;&#xb0b4; &#xc6b0;&#xc218; &#xae30;&#xc220; &#xacac;&#xd559; &#xae30;&#xd68c; &#xc81c;&#xacf5;</narrative>
  </description>
